4. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE PATTERNS FOR LOW LATENCY

   4.1 Pipeline Architecture (Lock-Free Stages)
   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │ [Ingest] → [Decode] → [Strategy] → [Risk] → [Order] → [Send]      │
   │    │           │           │           │          │          │      │
   │   SPSC       SPSC        SPSC        SPSC       SPSC      SPSC     │
   │   Queue      Queue       Queue       Queue      Queue     Queue    │
   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
   - Each stage runs on dedicated CPU core
   - Lock-free SPSC queues between stages
   - No shared state between stages
   - Zero-copy where possible

